         version (ServiceUnavailableException / never fires at all - see repo memory notes), so
         the classic WPF Options UI was restored as the actual settings UI. Kept compiled out
         (not deleted) so it can be re-enabled later by flipping this to true, without having to
         reconstruct everything from git history again. -->
